This License governs the use, modification, distribution, and deployment of the 
kinetic-collapse software repository, including its 80-dimensional continuous 
manifold setups, analytical Jacobian derivative fields, tensor track calculations, 
discrete balanced ternary evaluation operators, and accompanying formal proof-state 
