The mathematical primitives of this architecture manage geometric connections and 
error-filtering tracks inside multi-dimensional manifolds. Because these coordinate 
systems are inherently dual-use and functionally identical to target localization and 
autonomous weapon routing vectors, this License structurally binds the software to an 
absolute, un-waivable mandate of civilian preservation and non-harm.

Accordingly, the permissions granted under this License are strictly conditional 
upon absolute adherence to the Humanitarian Safeguards detailed herein.

